WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.007 --> 00:00:19.808
"It is a perfect spring day!" Jeremy Fisher said.

2
00:00:19.809 --> 00:00:25.307
"Sunshine! Green fly sandwiches!

3
00:00:25.308 --> 00:00:35.003
I'm going to paddle my boat on the pond."

4
00:00:35.004 --> 00:00:39.244
Jeremy climbed into his boat.

5
00:00:39.245 --> 00:00:45.487
He began paddling.

6
00:00:45.488 --> 00:00:49.113
Then he spotted something.

7
00:00:49.114 --> 00:00:54.053
A frog was walking along the pond.

8
00:00:54.054 --> 00:00:57.298
"A new neighbor," Jeremy thought.

9
00:00:57.299 --> 00:01:04.035
"I must meet her!"

10
00:01:04.036 --> 00:01:11.843
Jeremy paddled his boat to the shore.

11
00:01:11.844 --> 00:01:21.718
He tied it to a tall reed.

12
00:01:21.719 --> 00:01:25.788
Then he hopped toward the new frog.

13
00:01:25.789 --> 00:01:29.075
"Hello!" said the frog.

14
00:01:29.076 --> 00:01:32.149
"My name is Ribby Webb.

15
00:01:32.150 --> 00:01:35.620
This pond is my new home."

16
00:01:35.621 --> 00:01:39.617
Jeremy stared at the frog.

17
00:01:39.618 --> 00:01:43.035
She had small brown spots.

18
00:01:43.043 --> 00:01:46.400
She wore a pretty, long dress.

19
00:01:46.401 --> 00:01:50.307
"This frog is beautiful!" he thought.

20
00:01:50.308 --> 00:01:55.769
Jeremy blushed.

21
00:01:55.770 --> 00:02:01.876
"M-m-my name is Jeremy Fisher," he said.

22
00:02:01.877 --> 00:02:04.704
"I live on the pond too."

23
00:02:04.705 --> 00:02:06.894
Ribby smiled at him.

24
00:02:06.895 --> 00:02:14.891
"How nice. You're my neighbor."

25
00:02:14.892 --> 00:02:18.765
Suddenly the tall grass swished.

26
00:02:18.766 --> 00:02:23.646
The two frogs looked over.

27
00:02:23.647 --> 00:02:31.803
"What's that?" Ribby asked.

28
00:02:31.804 --> 00:02:38.324
Jeremy gasped. "It's a water rat!"
